/target/
/amatl.toml
/amatl.sqlite3*
# Covers every backup AMATL's own storage module produces next to the live
# DB — auto (`.backup-`), migration (`.migration-`) and pre-restore
# (`.pre-restore-`) — none of which match the literal prefix above, and all
# of which can carry the operator's real search history/saved documents.
/amatl*.sqlite3*
# AUDIT-02: server integration runs can create their state database below a
# crate directory. Keep every AMATL SQLite database and its backups local.
**/amatl*.sqlite3*
# AUDIT-03: runtime logs are local operational output, never source material.
*.log
**/*.cdx.json
**/*.cdx.xml
/.env
/.claude/
*.pem
*.key
*~
